        "text": "### Page\n- Page URL: http://localhost:7063/\n- Page Title: Lovable App\n- Console: 0 errors, 2 warnings\n### Snapshot\n```yaml\n- generic [ref=e2]:\n  - region \"Notifications (F8)\":\n    - list\n  - region \"Notifications alt+T\"\n  - generic [ref=e3]:\n    - banner [ref=e4]:\n      - generic [ref=e5]:\n        - link \"遗 华夏非遗 Chinese Intangible Heritage\" [ref=e6] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /\n          - generic [ref=e8]: 遗\n          - generic [ref=e9]:\n            - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=1] [ref=e10]\n            - paragraph [ref=e11]: Chinese Intangible Heritage\n        - navigation [ref=e12]:\n          - link \"首页\" [ref=e13] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /\n          - link \"全景探索\" [ref=e14] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: /?view=panorama\n          - link \"分类浏览\" [ref=e15] [cursor=pointer]:\n            - /url: \"#categories\"\n        - link \"开始探索\" [ref=e17] [cursor=pointer]:\n          - /url: /?view=panorama\n    - main [ref=e18]:\n      - generic [ref=e19]:\n        - generic [ref=e24]:\n          - generic [ref=e25]:\n            - generic [ref=e27]: 遗\n            - heading \"华夏非物质 文化遗产\" [level=1] [ref=e28]:\n              - text: 华夏非物质\n              - text: 文化遗产\n            - paragraph [ref=e29]:\n              - text: 沉浸式探索中国千年传承的文化瑰宝\n              - text: 感受传统工艺、民俗活动与表演艺术的独特魅力\n            - generic [ref=e30]:\n              - link \"进入全景探索\" [ref=e31] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: /?view=panorama\n              - link \"浏览项目列表\" [ref=e32] [cursor=pointer]:\n                - /url: \"#categories\"\n          - generic [ref=e33]:\n            - generic [ref=e34]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e35]: \"43\"\n              - paragraph [ref=e36]: 世界级遗产\n            - generic [ref=e37]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e38]: \"1557\"\n              - paragraph [ref=e39]: 国家级项目\n            - generic [ref=e40]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e41]: \"34\"\n              - paragraph [ref=e42]: 省市覆盖\n            - generic [ref=e43]:\n              - paragraph [ref=e44]: 10+\n              - paragraph [ref=e45]: 门类分类\n        - generic [ref=e50]:\n          - generic [ref=e51]:\n            - heading \"非遗项目\" [level=2] [ref=e52]\n            - paragraph [ref=e53]: 探索中国丰富多彩的非物质文化遗产，感受千年传承的文化魅力\n          - generic [ref=e54]:\n            - textbox \"搜索非遗项目...\" [ref=e56]\n            - combobox [ref=e57] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 全部类别\n              - img [ref=e58]\n            - combobox [ref=e60] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 全部地区\n              - img [ref=e61]\n            - combobox [ref=e63] [cursor=pointer]:\n              - generic: 按名称\n              - img [ref=e64]\n          - paragraph [ref=e66]: 共 8 个非遗项目\n          - generic [ref=e67]:\n            - generic [ref=e68]:\n              - generic [ref=e69]:\n                - img \"春节\" [ref=e70]\n                - generic [ref=e72]: 民俗活动\n                - generic [ref=e73]:\n                  - heading \"春节\" [level=3] [ref=e74]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e75]: Spring Festival\n              - generic [ref=e76]:\n                - generic [ref=e77]:\n                  - img [ref=e78]\n                  - generic [ref=e81]: 北京 · 华夏大地\n                - paragraph [ref=e82]: 春节是中国最重要的传统节日，承载着团圆、祈福、辞旧迎新等丰富的文化内涵。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e83] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/spring-festival\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e84]\n            - generic [ref=e86]:\n              - generic [ref=e87]:\n                - img \"端午龙舟\" [ref=e88]\n                - generic [ref=e90]: 民俗活动\n                - generic [ref=e91]:\n                  - heading \"端午龙舟\" [level=3] [ref=e92]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e93]: Dragon Boat Racing\n              - generic [ref=e94]:\n                - generic [ref=e95]:\n                  - img [ref=e96]\n                  - generic [ref=e99]: 广东 · 楚地遗风\n                - paragraph [ref=e100]: 龙舟竞渡是端午节最具代表性的民俗活动，承载着对屈原的纪念和对美好生活的祈愿。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e101] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/dragon-boat\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e102]\n            - generic [ref=e104]:\n              - generic [ref=e105]:\n                - img \"剪纸\" [ref=e106]\n                - generic [ref=e108]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e109]:\n                  - heading \"剪纸\" [level=3] [ref=e110]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e111]: Paper Cutting\n              - generic [ref=e112]:\n                - generic [ref=e113]:\n                  - img [ref=e114]\n                  - generic [ref=e117]: 陕西 · 黄土高原\n                - paragraph [ref=e118]: 剪纸是中国最古老的民间艺术之一，用剪刀或刻刀在纸上剪刻花纹，寓意吉祥美好。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e119] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/paper-cutting\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e120]\n            - generic [ref=e122]:\n              - generic [ref=e123]:\n                - img \"京剧\" [ref=e124]\n                - generic [ref=e126]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e127]:\n                  - heading \"京剧\" [level=3] [ref=e128]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e129]: Peking Opera\n              - generic [ref=e130]:\n                - generic [ref=e131]:\n                  - img [ref=e132]\n                  - generic [ref=e135]: 北京 · 京城古韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e136]: 京剧是中国影响最大的戏曲剧种，被誉为\"国粹\"，以唱念做打的表演方式闻名于世。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e137] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/peking-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e138]\n            - generic [ref=e140]:\n              - generic [ref=e141]:\n                - img \"昆曲\" [ref=e142]\n                - generic [ref=e144]: 传统表演\n                - generic [ref=e145]:\n                  - heading \"昆曲\" [level=3] [ref=e146]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e147]: Kunqu Opera\n              - generic [ref=e148]:\n                - generic [ref=e149]:\n                  - img [ref=e150]\n                  - generic [ref=e153]: 江苏 · 姑苏雅韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e154]: 昆曲是中国最古老的戏曲剧种之一，被誉为\"百戏之祖\"，以典雅细腻的表演著称。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e155] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/kunqu-opera\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e156]\n            - generic [ref=e158]:\n              - generic [ref=e159]:\n                - img \"书法\" [ref=e160]\n                - generic [ref=e162]: 传统美术\n                - generic [ref=e163]:\n                  - heading \"书法\" [level=3] [ref=e164]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e165]: Chinese Calligraphy\n              - generic [ref=e166]:\n                - generic [ref=e167]:\n                  - img [ref=e168]\n                  - generic [ref=e171]: 安徽 · 神州墨韵\n                - paragraph [ref=e172]: 书法是中国特有的艺术形式，以毛笔书写汉字，融合了文字、绘画与哲学的精髓。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e173] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/chinese-calligraphy\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e174]\n            - generic [ref=e176]:\n              - generic [ref=e177]:\n                - img \"苏绣\" [ref=e178]\n                - generic [ref=e180]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e181]:\n                  - heading \"苏绣\" [level=3] [ref=e182]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e183]: Suzhou Embroidery\n              - generic [ref=e184]:\n                - generic [ref=e185]:\n                  - img [ref=e186]\n                  - generic [ref=e189]: 江苏 · 江南水乡\n                - paragraph [ref=e190]: 苏绣是中国四大名绣之一，以精细雅洁著称，图案秀丽、针法活泼、色彩清雅。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e191] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/suzhou-embroidery\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e192]\n            - generic [ref=e194]:\n              - generic [ref=e195]:\n                - img \"宜兴紫砂\" [ref=e196]\n                - generic [ref=e198]: 传统工艺\n                - generic [ref=e199]:\n                  - heading \"宜兴紫砂\" [level=3] [ref=e200]\n                  - paragraph [ref=e201]: Yixing Purple Clay\n              - generic [ref=e202]:\n                - generic [ref=e203]:\n                  - img [ref=e204]\n                  - generic [ref=e207]: 江苏 · 太湖之滨\n                - paragraph [ref=e208]: 宜兴紫砂壶以独特的紫砂泥料制成，造型古朴典雅，是中国传统茶文化的重要载体。\n                - link \"了解详情\" [ref=e209] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: /heritage/yixing-teapot\n                  - text: 了解详情\n                  - img [ref=e210]\n    - contentinfo [ref=e212]:\n      - generic [ref=e213]:\n        - generic [ref=e214]:\n          - generic [ref=e215]:\n            - generic [ref=e216]:\n              - generic [ref=e218]: 遗\n              - heading \"华夏非遗\" [level=3] [ref=e220]\n            - paragraph [ref=e221]: 致力于保护和传承中国非物质文化遗产，让千年文化在数字时代焕发新的生机。\n          - generic [ref=e222]:\n            - heading \"探索分类\" [level=4] [ref=e223]\n            - list [ref=e224]:\n              - listitem [ref=e225]:\n                - link \"传统工艺\" [ref=e226] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e227]:\n                - link \"传统表演\" [ref=e228] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e229]:\n                - link \"民俗活动\" [ref=e230] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n              - listitem [ref=e231]:\n                - link \"传统美术\" [ref=e232] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#categories\"\n          - generic [ref=e233]:\n            - heading \"了解更多\" [level=4] [ref=e234]\n            - list [ref=e235]:\n              - listitem [ref=e236]:\n                - link \"关于我们\" [ref=e237] [cursor=pointer]:\n                  - /url: \"#\"\n              - listitem [ref=e238]:\n           